      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Abysmal Sea [zone=236]\n**Who:**\n- L`diava Rexxen [npc=14247]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Time:** | Weeks\n**Level:** | 65\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Loot\n**Quest Items:**\n- Kitren's Tattered Cloak [item=29286]\n- Sealed Confession [item=29285]\n- Sealed Note [item=59766]\n- Smoky Gem Shard [item=29011]\n- Translucent Green Gemstone [item=29010]\n- Vaifan's Clockwork Gemcutter Tools [item=28974]\n- Vaifan's Experimental Sealer [item=26411]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Ikkinz, Chambers of Destruction [zone=248]\n- Kod'Taz, Broken Trial Grounds [zone=249]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Fezbin Fizzles [npc=14240]\n- Kevren Nalavat [npc=15987]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Breakdown in Communication #0: Pre-Flag [quest=2781]\n- Breakdown in Communication #10: Free Stuff [quest=2880]\n- Breakdown in Communication #11: Qvic [quest=2881]\n- Breakdown in Communication #12: Inktu'ta [quest=2882]\n- Breakdown in Communication #13: Txevu [quest=2891]\n- Breakdown in Communication #14: Tacvi [quest=2909]\n- Breakdown in Communication #1: Qinimi [quest=2868]\n- Breakdown in Communication #2: Barindu [quest=2869]\n- Breakdown in Communication #3: Riwwi [quest=2870]\n- Breakdown in Communication #4: Ferubi [quest=2871]\n- Breakdown in Communication #5: Sewers [quest=2872]\n- Breakdown in Communication #6: Vxed [quest=2873]\n- Breakdown in Communication #7: Tipt [quest=2874]\n- Breakdown in Communication #8: Yxtta [quest=2875]\n- Gates of Discord Progression #3: The Ikkinz Group Trials [quest=7591]\n- Gates of Discord Progression #4a: Martyrs Passage [quest=7592]\n- Gates of Discord Progression #4b: Temple of the Damned [quest=7593]\n- Gates of Discord Progression #4c: The Summoner Ring [quest=7594]\n- Gates of Discord Progression #4d: Pit of the Lost [quest=2919]\n- Gates of Discord Progression #4e: Crumbled Sanctuary [quest=7595]\n- Gates of Discord Progression #5: Crafting an Icon of the Altar [quest=7597]\n- Ikkinz Group Trial #1: Singular Might [quest=3458]\n- Ikkinz Group Trial #2: Twin Struggles [quest=3459]\n- Ikkinz Group Trial #3: Tri-Fates [quest=3460]\n**Era:** | !Gates of Discord\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Jun 6 23:02:57 2004\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Talk to L`diava Rexxen**\n_L`diava Rexxen may be found near Fezbin Fizzles at -35, +60, with whom you must have already completed the preflagging to accomplish this step of the quest._\nYou say, 'Hail, L`diava Rexxen'\nL`diava Rexxen says 'Yes, yes. What is it I can do for you? I am a very busy woman and do not have a moment to waste on just anyone. Are you one of the adventurers sent here by Fezbin?'\nYou say, 'Yes.'\nL`diava Rexxen says 'Very good. You are just in time. I am in need of immediate assistance in the temple areas known as [Yxtta] and the [frightful temple], Kod'Taz. While our scouts have been missing for quite some time, I recently received some information that leads me to believe they may still be alive. Which one we help first is up to you. Which area do you wish to investigate?'\nYou say, 'What frightful temple?'\nL`diava Rexxen says 'Kod'Taz is made up of multiple temples that were once used for worship by the trusik natives. Many of them have since been destroyed or made into strongholds for the Muramite army. Due to the sheer size of this area, we sent a scouting force there to investigate. All of them are still alive, save one, named Kitren Lanom. None of the scouts left in the area know what happened to her or her belongings. Last time they remember seeing her was when she entered the Temple of Tri-Fates in an attempt to pass the temple trial. Please go to Kod'Taz and speak to Kevren Nalavat. He should be able to help you access the three trials. You will have to enter each trial and bring me back anything you find of Kitren's from each temple. Even though the scouts there have searched many times for something, I think a fresh set of eyes may help some. Kevren is the only one who knows you are helping me. Please do not let the others know you were sent by me. I have not yet ruled out the possibility of foul play and if they are aware of your affiliation, it may place you in more danger.'\n_Kitren's Tattered Cloak may be found in A Pile of Bones, the reward chest at the end of the **third Ikkinz trial** [quest=7591]. Give it to L`diava._\nL`diava Rexxen says 'Oh, thank you brave adventurer. We are now one step closer to finding out what happened to Kitren. Now, give me one second to look through the cloak here and . . . here it is, Kitren's notebook. There must be some information here that can help us more. While I read through this, I need you to return to Kevren Nalavat. He believes he may have found more clues to Kitren's whereabouts and since you did such a good job with the trials he believes you may be able to help him. Even though you have proven yourself by defeating the trials, he will not give you what I need unless you help him. When you return to him, show him this letter and it will confirm my trust in you. Hurry now. There no time to waste!'\n_You receive a Sealed Note. Find Kevren Nalavat at 1020, -1040 and give him the note from L`diava._\nKevren Nalavat says 'Seems you have made quite an impression if you are trusted by L`diava. But don't think that this means you do not have to gain my trust. While you survived the three trials I am still in need of assistance, I some [other tasks] completed, when you have finished them please return to me and tell me you have done all I asked and I will give you what you came here for. If you do not wish to start these tasks right now we do have some time to talk a little [more].'\n_Asking about the \"other tasks\" leads you to the standard **Kod'Taz flag progression** [quest=7592]. You do need to complete some of that progression to get the Kod'taz reward:_\n- You've recovered important glyphs from the Temple of the Damned!\n- You've successfully translated the glyphs you found in the Temple of the Damned!\n- You were able to recover a rare artifact from the Grand Summoner's goons in the Summoning Circle!\n- You've returned four relics from the Martyrs Passage!\n- You've returned valuable information as to why the Muramites are in the Martyrs Passage!\n_After doing that:_\nYou say, 'I have done all you asked.'\nKevren Nalavat says 'Indeed you have and your help is greatly appreciated. Take this back to L`diava I believe it has the answers she seeks.'\n_You receive a Sealed Confession. Take it back to L`diava._\nL`diava Rexxen says 'Once again, a job well done. I hear you accomplished the tasks with flying colors. Now let's see what this says. Hm . . . this changes everything. I never suspected something like this, but now that I know, it all makes sense to me. Oh poor Kitren, why didn't you warn me first? Please leave me be. I must take sometime to think. Take this as proof of your accomplishments in Kod'Taz. It possesses a power that you can unlock when you combine it with the stone from Fezbin. Return to me later if you wish to investigate Yxtta.'\nFlag: You were successful in helping L`diava complete her report of Kod'Taz. Fezbin will be pleased, but there are others who need your help.\nYou have succeeded in retrieving all the information the Wayfarers Brotherhood was seeking. Return to Fezbin and tell him you have completed your task so that he can give you your final reward.\n_You receive A Smoky Gem Shard, which may be combined with A Translucent Green Gemstone and Vaifan's Clockwork Gemcutter Tools in Vaifan's Experimental Sealer to craft one of four versions of a Smokey Green Gemstone (melee, hybrid, caster, priest)._\n- Smokey Green Gemstone [Melee]\n- Smokey Green Gemstone [Priest]\n- Smokey Green Gemstone [Hybrid]\n- Smokey Green Gemstone [Caster]",
