      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Abysmal Sea [zone=236]\n**Who:**\n- Beanalle Banoam [npc=14238]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Time:** | Weeks\n**Level:** | 65\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Items:**\n- Condensed Matter Shard [Txevu]\n- Jagged Black Matter Gemstone [Caster]\n- Jagged Black Matter Gemstone [Hybrid]\n- Jagged Black Matter Gemstone [Priest]\n- Jagged Black Matter Gemstone [Melee]\n- Shard of Dark Matter [Txevu]\n- Vaifan's Clockwork Gemcutter Tools [item=28974]\n- Vaifan's Experimental Sealer [item=26411]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Txevu, Lair of the Elite [zone=251]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Fezbin Fizzles [npc=14240]\n- Zun`Muram Tkarish Zyk [npc=15405]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Breakdown in Communication #0: Pre-Flag [quest=2781]\n- Breakdown in Communication #10: Free Stuff [quest=2880]\n- Breakdown in Communication #11: Qvic [quest=2881]\n- Breakdown in Communication #12: Inktu'ta [quest=2882]\n- Breakdown in Communication #14: Tacvi [quest=2909]\n- Breakdown in Communication #1: Qinimi [quest=2868]\n- Breakdown in Communication #2: Barindu [quest=2869]\n- Breakdown in Communication #3: Riwwi [quest=2870]\n- Breakdown in Communication #4: Ferubi [quest=2871]\n- Breakdown in Communication #5: Sewers [quest=2872]\n- Breakdown in Communication #6: Vxed [quest=2873]\n- Breakdown in Communication #7: Tipt [quest=2874]\n- Breakdown in Communication #8: Yxtta [quest=2875]\n- Breakdown in Communication #9: Kod'Taz [quest=2876]\n- Gates of Discord Progression #7: Access to Txevu [quest=2917]\n**Era:** | !Gates of Discord\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Jun 24 07:10:55 2004\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _Beanalle Banoam may be found at -440, +220, +90. You must have already completed steps 0-12 to accomplish this step of the quest._\n_A Shard of Dark Matter is an uncommon drop from Zun`Muram Tkarish Zyk, the boss of Txevu. Bring it back to Beanalle Banoam._\nBeanalle Banoam says 'Ah, perfect. I am glad you were successful in finding it. Now, if you will give me one second I will condense the shard into concentrated energy which you can add to your stone. There we are. Please take the time to attach this, but make sure you do it in the order I mentioned when we first spoke.'\n_You receive a Condensed Matter Shard (looks the same as the one for completing steps 11, 12, and 14, but identifies as \"Pure Matter Extracted From A Brightly Glowing Shard\"), which is then combined with your class archetype-specific Jagged Black Matter Gemstone with Vaifan's Clockwork Gemcutter Tools in Vaifan's Experimental Sealer to craft a class archetype-specific reward._\n**Submitted by:** Fleven, KyrosKrane, numerous folks at The Safehouse\n- Smooth Black Matter Gemstone [Caster]\n- Smooth Black Matter Gemstone [Hybrid]\n- Smooth Black Matter Gemstone [Melee]\n- Smooth Black Matter Gemstone [Priest]",
